---
config:
  theme: base
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: true
    useMaxWidth: false
    wrap: true
    actorMargin: 35
    messageMargin: 32
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor User as Operator
  box Controller process
    participant C as Worker / Compute / Sandbox
  end
  participant O as OpenShell gateway / Driver
  participant K as Kubernetes / kubelet
  box Separate supervisor Pod
    participant S as Supervisor
  end
  box Agent workload Pod
    participant A as Boundary / Codex child
  end
  participant G as Native OCE Gateway Pod
  Note over User,G: 1. Proposed ordinary deployment, not installed qualification
  User->>C: Authenticated deployment with selected workspace and resources
  C->>C: Derive exact revision requirements and retain original authority
  C->>O: Provision scoped requirements through accepted mapping
  O->>K: Read exact resource identities
  K-->>O: Scoped resource metadata
  O->>O: Admit scope and record UIDs
  alt Unsupported, foreign or replaced reference
    O-->>C: Candidate unavailable
    C-->>User: No activation
  else Approved projection contract
    Note over O,A: 2. Proposed projection and child delivery
    O->>S: Start separate supervisor under its own identity
    O->>K: Render workload Secret refs, ServiceAccount, token and PVC mounts
    K->>A: Resolve only approved workload capabilities
    A->>A: Admitted names handoff into child environment
    C->>C: Observe readiness for exact revision
    Note over C,G: 3. Route A evaluated first, endpoints and policy need proof
    C->>G: Existing private route and matching app capability
    G->>A: Current authenticated app-server request
    A-->>G: Observable result
    G-->>User: Useful result with separate mediation qualification
  end
  Note over User,G: 4. Consequential loss and owner recovery
  G->>A: Request may arrive before connection loss
  Note over A,G: Lost reply leaves effect unknown
  G-->>C: Preserve unknown under original request/effect owner
  C->>C: No replay or compensation from transport uncertainty
  Note over C,A: Correlations and PVC may survive, but cannot settle remote effects
  C->>G: Stop/replacement withdraws old authority and transport
  Note over C,G: Current authority, exact revision and observed closure required
